config FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ_SNMP_READER
	bool "Domoticz plugin: SNMP reader"
	depends on FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ
	select FREETZ_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_PYSNMP
	default n
	help
		readings from SNMP v1, v2c and v3 agents (switches, printers, NAS, UPS) exposed as Domoticz sensors (it queries the agents with pysnmp).

		It is a Python plugin of Domoticz: the package installs it into
		/usr/share/domoticz/plugins/SNMPreader, the directory Domoticz is
		started with (-approot of the domoticz package), and it needs no
		change of the Domoticz build.

		Setup -> Hardware -> SNMP reader, enter the address of the agent, the SNMP version, the community or credentials and the OIDs to read.

		Licensed upstream (LICENSE is installed with the plugin). The
		repository has no release tags, so the build fetches a pinned commit of
		the default branch.
